        "functionality": "Maps the firmware-visible register file and performs decode of the small CSR window. The block stores configuration for enable, sequence enforcement, stale threshold, watchdog limit, minimum and maximum command bounds, default mode, and sticky-fault clear control. It returns readback of current status and configuration. Every declared register must be reachable through decode.",
