        "reset_behavior": "On reset, configuration registers initialize to safe defaults with enable deasserted, sequence enforcement enabled, stale threshold and watchdog limit set to conservative safe values, bounds set to neutral-safe limits, default mode cleared to benign default, and sticky-fault clear deasserted. CSR read data and ready are returned deterministically from the registered state.",
        "behavior_rules": [
          "Every implemented register field must be reachable via the decode map.",
          "Writes only affect writable fields; read-only status fields are not directly writable.",
          "Sticky-fault clear is pulsed or level-encoded as implemented, but only through a CSR write to the designated register.",
          "CSR responses must be deterministic and registered.",
          "No registers other than the declared fields are software-visible."
